WEBVTT

00:09:56.916 --> 00:10:01.316
if in fact I bring everything to the table
and still it's not enough?

00:10:01.356 --> 00:10:05.196
I had the opportunity to ask
some questions, you know, like,

00:10:05.236 --> 00:10:08.796
what would it take for me to be ready
for the next opportunity?

00:10:09.356 --> 00:10:10.836
Which is actually the question

00:10:10.876 --> 00:10:12.996
and I really encourage
others to always ask.

00:10:13.036 --> 00:10:15.996
And the response to that question
was not satisfactory.

00:10:15.996 --> 00:10:18.116
It was vague, it was about time --

00:10:18.156 --> 00:10:20.076
And so you know, the thing is,

00:10:20.116 --> 00:10:25.716
Deepa, that it’s really important
for a person like me to know my “why.”

00:10:25.756 --> 00:10:26.916
Why am I here?

00:10:26.916 --> 00:10:28.396
What is my value?

00:10:28.436 --> 00:10:31.876
And then I can evaluate
how the organization responds to me.